# ChisokuLabs

> Before leadership approves a major ERP or core-platform go-live, ChisokuLabs independently tests whether every critical readiness claim has the status, owner, evidence, date and action to defend that decision.

Independent go-live decision assurance. Your programme reports Green. We test whether the evidence agrees.

## Offers
- [Readiness Evidence Check](https://www.chisokulabs.com/readiness-evidence-check): 5 business days, USD 5,000.
- [Go-Live Decision Review](https://www.chisokulabs.com/go-live-decision-review): 10 business days, USD 12,000. Ends in Go, Conditional Go or No-Go with the conditions, owners and dates behind it.
- Continuous readiness assurance: from USD 6,000 per month, until go-live and hypercare.
- Fee credit: The full Evidence Check fee is credited against a Go-Live Decision Review signed within 90 days of the Evidence Check report.
- Founding-client rate: the first three clients pay 50% of list price in exchange for a named or anonymised case study. Places remaining: 3.

## Method
- READINESS-5 tests every critical claim for Status, Owner, Evidence, Date and Action. Contradiction testing then checks the claims against each other, because the most expensive risks sit between workstreams. [Method](https://www.chisokulabs.com/method)

## Markets
- ERP and core-platform programmes in the United Arab Emirates and Saudi Arabia, on SAP S/4HANA, Oracle Fusion, Microsoft Dynamics 365, Salesforce and Workday. Remote by default, on site by arrangement.
- [Go-live readiness in the UAE](https://www.chisokulabs.com/go-live-readiness-uae)
- [Go-live readiness in Saudi Arabia](https://www.chisokulabs.com/go-live-readiness-saudi-arabia)

## Independence and data
- No implementation fees, no software resale, no system integrator partnerships or referral fees. Client evidence is processed under a written data-handling policy and never used to train AI models. The review does not guarantee go-live success. [Independence and data handling](https://www.chisokulabs.com/independence-and-data)

## Proof
- ChisokuLabs publishes no client names, testimonials or case studies.
- The sample decision pack is labelled: "Illustrative example. Fictional programme. Not a client engagement."

## Key pages
- [Independent Go-Live Decision Assurance](https://www.chisokulabs.com): Before leadership approves an ERP or core-platform go-live, we test whether every critical readiness claim has the evidence to defend that decision.
- [Readiness Evidence Check](https://www.chisokulabs.com/readiness-evidence-check): A five-day written review of your programme's readiness evidence. Fixed fee: USD 5,000.
- [Go-Live Decision Review](https://www.chisokulabs.com/go-live-decision-review): A ten-day independent review that gives your steering committee a defensible go-live decision: Go, Conditional Go or No-Go.
- [READINESS-5: how we test a go-live claim](https://www.chisokulabs.com/method): Every critical readiness claim tested for Status, Owner, Evidence, Date and Action (READINESS-5), then cross-checked between workstreams.
- [See the work before you talk to us](https://www.chisokulabs.com/see-it-first): View or download the full sample decision pack, no form. Or request a free readiness brief on your programme, prepared from public information.
- [Pricing](https://www.chisokulabs.com/pricing): The full Evidence Check fee is credited against a Go-Live Decision Review signed within 90 days of the Evidence Check report.
- [Independence and data handling](https://www.chisokulabs.com/independence-and-data): No implementation fees, no software resale, no system integrator partnerships or referral fees. How client evidence is handled, and how AI is used.
- [Go-live readiness in the UAE](https://www.chisokulabs.com/go-live-readiness-uae): Independent go-live decision assurance for ERP and core-platform programmes in the UAE. Two dates are adding go-lives to UAE programmes.
- [Go-live readiness in Saudi Arabia](https://www.chisokulabs.com/go-live-readiness-saudi-arabia): Independent go-live decision assurance for ERP and core-platform programmes in Saudi Arabia. Two dates are adding go-lives to Saudi programmes.
- [FAQ](https://www.chisokulabs.com/faq): Independent go-live decision assurance: how it differs from an SI readiness review, timing, platforms, data handling, AI use, prices and the fee credit.
- [Glossary](https://www.chisokulabs.com/glossary): Go-live readiness terms: go/no-go decision, Conditional Go, cutover, rollback point, hypercare, SIT, UAT, data migration reconciliation and READINESS-5.

